{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789885027835,"sessionID":"ses_f428a512fffed89OwSRaaEXqP0","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_bcceaa6d3e384ea8a3dd9c06","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"^## \\d+","path":"C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\.opencode\\skills\\interactive-comprehensive-exam-generator\\SKILL.md"},"output":"Found 100 matches (more matches available)\nC:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\.opencode\\skills\\interactive-comprehensive-exam-generator\\SKILL.md:\n  Line 8: ## 1. Role\n\n  Line 22: ## 2. Reference Material Priority\n\n  Line 42: ## 3. Chapter Organization\n\n  Line 63: ## 4. Chapter Start Requirement\n\n  Line 87: ## 5. Chapter Mode State\n\n  Line 112: ## 6. Timed Mode\n\n  Line 136: ## 7. Untimed Mode\n\n  Line 152: ## 8. Mode Immutability\n\n  Line 166: ## 9. Overall Exam\n\n  Line 190: ## 10. Active Chapter Lock\n\n  Line 207: ## 11. Chapter Exam Interface\n\n  Line 230: ## 12. Question Count\n\n  Line 249: ## 13. Multiple Choice Structure\n\n  Line 273: ## 14. Question Diversity\n\n  Line 299: ## 15. Difficulty\n\n  Line 319: ## 16. Bloom's Taxonomy\n\n  Line 335: ## 17. Anti-Guessing Requirement\n\n  Line 356: ## 18. Correct Answer Length\n\n  Line 374: ## 19. Longest-Answer Test\n\n  Line 388: ## 20. Shortest-Answer Test\n\n  Line 402: ## 21. Answer Choice Parity\n\n  Line 422: ## 22. Semantic Parity\n\n  Line 448: ## 23. Grammatical Parity\n\n  Line 463: ## 24. Specificity Parity\n\n  Line 482: ## 25. Technicality Parity\n\n  Line 499: ## 26. Professional-Wording Parity\n\n  Line 512: ## 27. Keyword Leakage\n\n  Line 538: ## 28. Absolute-Word Clues\n\n  Line 555: ## 29. Question Wording\n\n  Line 570: ## 30. Situational Questions\n\n  Line 588: ## 31. Comparison Questions\n\n  Line 602: ## 32. Exception Questions\n\n  Line 618: ## 33. Question Explanations\n\n  Line 632: ## 34. Immediate Feedback\n\n  Line 656: ## 35. Timeout Feedback\n\n  Line 674: ## 36. Scoring\n\n  Line 700: ## 37. Progress\n\n  Line 716: ## 38. Timer State\n\n  Line 742: ## 39. Timer Safety\n\n  Line 769: ## 40. Answer Locking\n\n  Line 788: ## 41. Stable Question IDs\n\n  Line 808: ## 42. Answer Mapping\n\n  Line 825: ## 43. Answer Position Balance\n\n  Line 851: ## 44. Avoid Answer Patterns\n\n  Line 875: ## 45. Answer Distribution Audit\n\n  Line 889: ## 46. Question Shuffling\n\n  Line 917: ## 47. Answer Shuffling\n\n  Line 932: ## 48. Shuffle Validation\n\n  Line 945: ## 49. Reset\n\n  Line 965: ## 50. Reset Safety\n\n  Line 987: ## 51. Chapter Completion\n\n  Line 1007: ## 52. Chapter Review\n\n  Line 1023: ## 53. Overall Exam Layout\n\n  Line 1052: ## 54. Overall Exam Question Source\n\n  Line 1071: ## 55. Overall Exam Independence\n\n  Line 1089: ## 56. Answer Key\n\n  Line 1114: ## 57. Answer Key During Active Exam\n\n  Line 1124: ## 58. Encyclopedia\n\n  Line 1153: ## 59. Encyclopedia Organization\n\n  Line 1172: ## 60. Navigation\n\n  Line 1189: ## 61. Chapter State\n\n  Line 1211: ## 62. Global Exam State\n\n  Line 1226: ## 63. UI Simplicity\n\n  Line 1248: ## 64. Responsive Design\n\n  Line 1263: ## 65. Accessibility\n\n  Line 1279: ## 66. Framework\n\n  Line 1297: ## 67. Existing Project Preservation\n\n  Line 1310: ## 68. Componentization\n\n  Line 1337: ## 69. Data Separation\n\n  Line 1358: ## 70. Question Metadata\n\n  Line 1385: ## 71. Coverage Planning\n\n  Line 1405: ## 72. Repetition Control\n\n  Line 1429: ## 73. Difficulty Distribution\n\n  Line 1446: ## 74. Distractor Design\n\n  Line 1463: ## 75. Distractor Quality Test\n\n  Line 1473: ## 76. Correct Answer Uniqueness\n\n  Line 1485: ## 77. Ambiguity Audit\n\n  Line 1497: ## 78. Reference Accuracy Audit\n\n  Line 1511: ## 79. Anti-Pattern Audit\n\n  Line 1530: ## 80. Answer Length Audit\n\n  Line 1548: ## 81. Answer Position Audit\n\n  Line 1567: ## 82. Randomization Audit\n\n  Line 1582: ## 83. Timer Audit\n\n  Line 1600: ## 84. Untimed Audit\n\n  Line 1615: ## 85. Mode Audit\n\n  Line 1641: ## 86. Locking Audit\n\n  Line 1659: ## 87. Reset Audit\n\n  Line 1681: ## 88. Final User Experience\n\n  Line 1701: ## 89. Generation Pipeline\n\n  Line 1761: ## 90. Priority Rules\n\n  Line 1778: ## 91. Final Question Standard\n\n  Line 1808: ## 92. Final Testing Requirements\n\n  Line 1867: ## 93. Implementation Safety\n\n  Line 1885: ## 94. Data Integrity\n\n  Line 1903: ## 95. No Fake Functionality\n\n  Line 1923: ## 96. No Unnecessary Complexity\n\n  Line 1938: ## 97. Final Delivery Checklist\n\n  Line 1975: ## 98. Final Requirement\n\n  Line 1987: ## 99. Professional Visual Design\n\n  Line 2068: ## 100. Exam Experience Modes\n\n\n(Results truncated. Consider using a more specific path or pattern.)","metadata":{"matches":100,"truncated":true},"title":"^## \\d+","time":{"start":1789885027446,"end":1789885027799}},"id":"prt_0bd7612aa001Z8k3ZurfOR2eB6","sessionID":"ses_f428a512fffed89OwSRaaEXqP0","messageID":"msg_0bd75ef5c00128jKgoFa84oW17"}}
