eline (the bank file is complete at the target path).\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\29l6wh2f5izows\\questions.json` — the deliverable being authored/fixed.\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\29l6wh2f5izows\\source.txt` — reference material (authoritative).\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\29l6wh2f5izows\\status.json` — currently `running`; must become `done` for api/data.php to serve the bank.\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\29l6wh2f5izows\\job.json` — job metadata (id/title/output/log paths).\n- `C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\audit.php` — JSON validity + A/B/C/D distribution + duplicate/longest audits.\n- `C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\rebalance.php` — answer-position rebalancer (Fisher-Yates letter multiset + choice rotation).\n- `C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\len_audit.php` — per-question choice-length outlier audit.\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\worker.php` and `api\\data.php` — schema/validation rules and serving conditions.\n- `C:\\xampp\\php\\php.exe` — PHP CLI used to run the audit/rebalance scripts.","time":{"start":1789885753394,"end":1789885765625}}}
